{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41186","headline":"和谒孔子庙 · 刘斌","name":"和谒孔子庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"性与虽天纵，主世乃无由。\n何言泰山毁，空惊逝水流。\n及门思往烈，入室想前修。\n寂寞荒堦暮，摧残古木秋。\n遗风暧如此，聊以慰蒸求。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘斌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41186.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41186","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}